 OptionsToolWithMultipleInfo;globalParms;list;parms;n1;flag;boolean
⍝ Presents a two-item list and a "info" that has ⋄ (separators) in it.
 list←'White' 'Red'
 parms←##.APLGUI.OptionsTool.CreateParms
 parms.caption←'Two-item list and a nested "info"'
 parms.info←'This is a complex info.⋄⋄In total it has a staggering four⋄lines of which the second one is empty.'
 n1←parms ##.APLGUI.OptionsTool.Create list
 (flag boolean)←##.APLGUI.OptionsTool.ModalWait n1

 :If flag
     ⎕←' User pressed the OK button'
     ⎕←⍪boolean/list
 :Else
     ⎕←'User did NOT press the OK button'
 :EndIf
